        "sectionLabel": "Where the error lives",
        "titleLine1": "Nobody underestimates",
        "titleAccent": "the typing.",
        "body": "Ask how long the work takes and people answer accurately. Ask how long it takes to <b>finish</b> and the answer is wrong by a factor, because finishing includes everything that is not the work: the review, the wait, the second opinion, the thing that turned out to be missing.",
